Assess ability to design a scalable, production-grade policy mechanism integrated with Kubernetes networking, not just a definition.

## Key Concepts
- CRD design for EgressPolicy per-namespace
- Controller pattern and idempotent reconciliation
- Translation to per-namespace NetworkPolicy egress rules
- Default-deny posture, per-namespace exceptions
- Observability: metrics, audit logs, events

